93
00:02:48.353 --> 00:02:50.053
Comece com cinco regras,

94
00:02:50.053 --> 00:02:51.093
como as da tela.

95
00:02:51.093 --> 00:02:52.153
Se travar,

96
00:02:52.153 --> 00:02:53.453
